                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/1604: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-02T16:00:00-04:00">September 2, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 2—3:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>246. Arbitral college of the Chaco formally constituted this morning the
                    Argentine Minister for Foreign Affairs chairman.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
